cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "RotQuant: rotation-based weight and KV-cache compression for LLMs"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Halwell
    given-names: Daniel
repository-code: "https://github.com/CodeHalwell/rotquant"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-08-31
abstract: >-
  A GPU-oriented assessment harness and runtime for TurboQuant-style
  rotation plus weight compression: exact-rate 1-8-bit scalar profiles,
  learned butterfly rotations, packed pickle-free checkpoints, a portable
  native C++ runtime, and rotation-aware KV-cache quantization, evaluated
  under a fixed matched-bits protocol.
